    {
      "body": "@simondanielsson @dllehr-amd Thanks for the review. I am moving this PR to draft currently. I am waiting for aiter PRs - [ROCm/aiter#6451](https://github.com/ROCm/aiter/pull/6451) (Triton/Gluon) and [ROCm/aiter#6450](https://github.com/ROCm/aiter/pull/6450) (FlyDSL) to land in vLLM's AITER pin. \r\nI need to reevaluate with an image which reverts the vllm pr - [#59420](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59420) and adds these aiter prs.\r\nThe .contiguous()'s copy in vllm pr - [#59420](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59420) (4us) cancels most of the native decode gain, so the delta is not significant.\r\nI will rerun the end to end numbers with the aiter PRs and reopen this PR. ",
