    {
      "body": "Thanks @amd-sriram!\n\n1. Can we also make it clear in the perf table the effect of this PR? I.e. say for MTP=5, what is the performance when using VLLM_ROCM_INDEXER_NATIVE_DECODE_MAX_NEXT_N=5 vs the default\n2. I think AITER also dispatches to one of several different indexer kernels under the hood, would be good to validate that the reachable ones all work natively (as Doug said, at least on gfx942/950). Could worth checking if rnda also dispatches to these kernels, otherwise we might want to guard this on cdna>2 ",
